      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INDY ALEX (1) is drawn well on the inside. Latest effort finished 2nd on September 15 over 461m at this track behind Selsdon beaten 5 lengths (26.35) in a Grade 6. Suited here and can find winning form. NITRO MOON (8) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in her head turning 29.69 win at Launceston over 515m. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. BROMPTON (2) was a (30.25) winner last time out at Launceston from Box 2. Leading player again. OPINIONS MATTER (7) is in form and must include among the chances.",
